{"ID":"20240118151244-uxxnfzz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151244-uxxnfzz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151244-uxxnfzz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151244-cw9a1o2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110507-mql2int\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110507-mql2int\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"108女贞实（女贞子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130101615"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151244-cw9a1o2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151244-cw9a1o2","updated":"20240122110457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主补中安五脏，养精神，除百疾，久服肥健，轻身不老。又名女贞子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110459-3refpfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110459-3refpfu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，生川谷中，叶隆冬不凋，实入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110501-3jkvo0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110501-3jkvo0n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110502-urdz9rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110502-urdz9rp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】女贞子为除热益精要药，主补中安五脏，养精神，健腰膝，治白发。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110504-vldpxaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110504-vldpxaj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110506-8hj987p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110506-8hj987p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】气味俱阴，老人当入保脾胃药及椒红温暖之剂，不然恐腹痛作泻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110458-zu9eheq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110458-zu9eheq"}},{"ID":"20240122110507-odiyk2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110507-odiyk2s"}},{"ID":"20240122110507-ag386xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110507-ag386xq","updated":"20240130101615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第108味药，女贞子。它叫女贞实，实际上就是女贞子。果实类的药。一般果实类的药都安五脏，那个滋补的功能。那味苦，平。苦味的药对心脏，那个对心脏也很好。那这个女贞子除热、益精的药，滋补的药，所以我们常常开年龄大一点的，我常常开一点女贞子在里面，女贞子是很普遍的药，开点女贞子的药在里面帮她滋补一下。诸位看看女贞子长什么样子？弯弯曲曲的一个，弯弯曲曲的好像小肾脏一样，那颜色比较暗一点，黑的，那你看他那个味道是苦味。"}]},{"ID":"20240122110507-mql2int","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110507-mql2int"}}]}